      "score": 87,
      "summary": "C has a compact P0-P3 table with useful escalation conditions, good failure and recovery handling, and handles both modal and nonmodal drawers. The reconciliation section is sound. Its performance thresholds are thin (p75 ≤200ms and CLS only) and it has no regression or row bounds. Fixes are concrete but mostly lack per-fix acceptance criteria, which leaves it behind A and B."
    },
